    dialogue: Europa 197 - The first batch of explorers have arrived, not only men
      but women and kids as well. Their eyes gleamed with hope. I admit I felt this
      unwitting jolt of joy to see someone again, how embarrassing.
    onLineStart:
      RelatedStaticEvent: 0
      _eventName: 
  - isLeft: 1
